This project uses the following third-party software (all installed from
their official distributions; no vendored copies):

- Ultralytics YOLOv8 (AGPL-3.0) — https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  Object-detection models and inference runtime (yolov8n.pt, yolov8s.pt).
- PyTorch (BSD-style) — https://pytorch.org/
  CPU-only build from https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu.
- torchvision (BSD-style) — CPU-only build, matching the +cpu torch.
- OpenCV / opencv-python (Apache 2.0) — https://opencv.org/
  Frame handling and JPEG encoding.
